Bundled third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Konoha ships the packages below inside its published tarball
(`bundleDependencies` and their transitive dependencies), because their patched
builds must reach consumers that install from the registry rather than from this
repository. Every one of them remains under its own license, and every one ships
its own unmodified license file inside its package directory. Nothing in this
notice relicenses them under Apache-2.0.

