`jszip` is dual-licensed MIT / GPL-3.0-or-later; Konoha redistributes it under the
MIT option only. `sax` ships under the BlueOak Model License 1.0.0, which is not a
copyleft license and imposes no obligation beyond retaining its notice. The
`@types/*` and `undici-types` entries are declaration-only packages: they carry
type definitions, no runtime code.

Four of these packages carry Konoha patches (`patches/`):

  cfb@1.2.2           removes a synthetic seed artifact
  jszip@3.10.2        deletes the Browserify `dist/` build and the `browser` field
  pptxgenjs@4.0.1     raises the `image-size` floor past CVE-2025-71330 /
                      CVE-2025-71329, drops `https@1.0.0`, deletes the webpack
                      browser bundle
  xlsx-populate@1.21.0  replaces `lodash` with an in-package shim, deletes the
                      prebuilt `browser/` bundle and `examples/`

Patched files are derivative works of the original packages and are distributed
under the same license as the package they patch.

